// WARN-DAG: Diag Warning: {{.*}}lossy lift [stack-adjacent-escape]: local 'local_c' (stack offset -12, 4 bytes) in function 'read_second' follows local 'auStack_10' (stack offset -16, 4 bytes) whose address is taken
// WARN-DAG: Diag Warning: {{.*}}lossy lift [stack-adjacent-escape]: local 'rec_lo' (stack offset -24, 4 bytes) in function 'piece_view' overlaps local 'rec' (stack offset -24, 8 bytes) whose address is taken
